@page "/counter"

@* Counter component — interactivity via WaspMarkers wrapping in App.razor
   (not @rendermode InteractiveServer — that path trips #76 JSON reflection).

   The component intentionally renders ONLY the dynamic parts (count value
   + button). The static <h1>Counter</h1> + <PageTitle> live in App.razor
   outside the marker boundary so they survive #80's empty-strings-table
   delta-batch wipe on circuit attach. *@

@* id="wasp-count" is required so the wasp-bridge.js post-click count
   restore (CircuitHubFacade._wapsClickCount + JS.BeginInvokeJS
   waspSetCount) can find this span. *@
<p role="status">Current count: <span id="wasp-count">@currentCount</span></p>

<button class="btn btn-primary" @onclick="IncrementCount">
    Click me
</button>

@code {
    private int currentCount = 0;

    private void IncrementCount()
    {
        currentCount++;
    }
}
